{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1065839/block/singleImage/3278679/df/01M8B893TN3A3SMS4VR52J2XZA.jpeg?updatedAt=1795674166\"/><figcaption>上水警署男警員疑自轟 當場死亡</figcaption></figure><p>上水警署傳出槍聲，有警員疑自轟身亡。 事發在今日（26日）上午10時54分，一名男警員據報在上水警署2樓位置，懷疑用配槍自轟。消息稱，涉事男警隸屬交通部。現場所見，有救護車到場候命，亦有刑事調查隊人員在警署內了解。 警方回覆《am730》表示，上水警署有一名男警身亡，毋須送院；事件懷疑與槍械有關。據了解，警方正循自殺方向調查。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T07:02:21.968105+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":180,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T04:23:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T07:56:26.818476+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:55:44.105541+00:00","content_hash":"18d36a0d9175fb717bd42f84d7dd1e02d4df70a4f2adc55a158f6b86ad5f03b8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T07:02:21.968105+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}